@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = {{login.response.body.data.access_token}}

### Public Overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/overview

### Login as Data Admin
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: Get Approval Queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: View System Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system-health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Repository: List Documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### AI Search: Semantic Hybrid Search
POST {{baseUrl}}/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Land use policies in district A",
  "limit": 5
}

### Analytics: Trend
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/trend?indicator=cropland_pct&regions=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Scenario: Get Parameters
GET {{baseUrl}}/scenarios/parameters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GIS: Get Regions
GET {{baseUrl}}/regions?level=district
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Workspace: List Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Innovation Portal: List Challenges
GET {{baseUrl}}/challenges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
